A. ACCEPT ORDER

When Admin clicks ACCEPT:

1. Verify order is pending.
2. Verify the customer is active.
3. Verify the saved price snapshot.
4. Check available stock.
5. Confirm the order.
6. Change status to CONFIRMED.
7. Record Admin ID.
8. Record approval timestamp.
9. Reserve stock according to inventory policy.
10. Notify the customer.
11. Notify the relevant staff if configured.

